{"decision":"edit","issues":[{"quote":"She holds a large, pale, glowing white sphere against her body","problem":"In the opening frames the sphere is held out to her side rather than pressed against her body."},{"quote":"beginning held out toward her left side","problem":"The sphere appears on the woman's right side, which is the viewer's left, not her left side."},{"quote":"Her stance and upper body rotate slightly to follow this movement","problem":"The visible change is mainly the sphere and arms moving around her torso; a clear rotation of her stance and upper body is not strongly evidenced."},{"quote":"the horizon, mountains, and sky stay fixed, indicating little camera translation or zoom","problem":"The background and framing show slight changes, so 'stay fixed' and the camera claim are too absolute."}],"caption":"The video captures a woman in a short, shiny silver dress and high-heeled sandals standing on a vast, mirror-like salt flat at dusk. A low mountain range sits on the horizon beneath a pale blue sky with a pink-orange glow on the left, and her reflection stretches across the wet surface. She holds a large, pale, glowing white sphere near her body, already in motion when the clip opens.

Over the excerpt the glowing sphere shifts position relative to the woman, beginning held out toward her right side at hip height and gradually drawn around toward the front of her torso. Her stance and upper body shift slightly with this movement, while her legs remain planted apart with one heel raised. The framing keeps her near the center and the horizon, mountains, and sky broadly steady, with only slight framing changes, while the sphere's size and brightness remain roughly constant, so the change is positional rather than an expansion.

The water reflection tracks the woman's pose and the sphere's position without showing separate moving objects.","length_note":""}
